course: dictionary
lesson: 8447
title: A grand word for wisdom
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Sagacity is a grand, formal word. It means wisdom and good judgement: being able to understand things and make good decisions.
explain: Use the context to check. «a man of infinite resource and sagacity» means he is endlessly clever and full of good sense. The words good sense are the clue that sagacity is about wisdom.
explain: In The Wind in the Willows, the Badger is the wise animal whose sagacity the others trust. Friends trust him because he judges well.
explain: Swap your meaning into the sentence. «a man of infinite resource and wisdom» still makes sense, so wisdom is a good meaning for sagacity.
fact: Sagacity means wisdom and good judgement.
fact: Sagacity is a noun that you cannot count: you say great sagacity, not a sagacity.
fact: Sagacity is a formal word, so writers use it when they want their writing to sound grand.
fact: Fables often praise the sagacity of the owl or the elephant.
fact: In exam writing, «sagacity» is a strong word to use instead of «wisdom».
exercise: What does sagacity mean? | *Wisdom and good judgement | Speed in running | A type of small sailing boat | Being loud at parties
exercise: In «a man of infinite resource and sagacity», what does sagacity suggest about the man? | He cannot count | *He is wise and makes good decisions | He is always lost | He is very tired
exercise: Find and copy the word for wisdom in this sentence: «The Badger's sagacity helped his friends.» | friends | helped | Badger | *sagacity
test: Nadia says sagacity is just a fancy word for clever. Why might an author choose sagacity? | It means being loud and cheerful | It means the same as lost | *It is a formal, grand word for wisdom and good judgement | It is only used about sailors
test: Which word is closest in meaning to sagacity? | Fear | Speed | Silliness | *Wisdom
exam: Which sentence uses sagacity correctly? | I ate some sagacity for lunch | The sky had a lovely sagacity of blue | *The old judge's sagacity helped her make a fair decision | The sagacity of the puppy made it run faster
